{"ts": "2026-10-29T07:41:37.450183Z", "run_id": "r-20261029T0735Z-b17c", "unit": "openspec:add-api-pep", "seq": 36, "type": "task.started", "task": "3.1", "title": "3.1 Write `src/api/pep.test.ts` first (scenarios \"No live session\", \"A live session sets the principal\", \"Authentication cannot run\" and \"One PEP per server\"; `withTestDatabase()`, `seedTwoTenants(db)`, a mutable clock and a real `createPolicyEngine`), then implement `createTestSession` in `test/support/api-session.ts` (one `withTenantTx(db.appPool, ctx, …)` with `upsertUserFromClaims` on `{ issuer: \"https://idp.test\", subject, name: subject }` and `createSession(tx, ctx, { userId }, { clock })`; then `resolveSession(db.appPool, sessionId, { clock })` and `issueCsrfToken(db.appPool, session, { clock })`; it returns `{ cookie: \"ursitoare_session=<sessionId>\", userId, csrfToken }`), the session verifier in `src/api/session-auth.ts` (`parseCookies` on the `cookie` header, `resolveSession(deps.pool, cookies[SESSION_COOKIE], { clock: deps.clock })`, then `{ principal: principalOf(session), tenant: session.tenant, session }`), `installPep` in `src/api/pep.ts` (parse `publicBaseUrl` once, else `ROUTE_DEF_INVALID` `public_base_url`; a second call is `ROUTE_DUPLICATE` with `details.what` `pep`; decorate `ursitoarePep`) and the `onRequest` authentication hook that `defineRoute` in `src/api/route.ts` attaches to every non-public route: `cache-control: no-store`; no `ursitoarePep`, or `pool` or `engine` null, is `ApiError(503, \"AUTHZ_UNAVAILABLE\", \"Authorization is unavailable\")`; `verifierFor(kind)` (the session verifier for `session`) answering `null` is `ApiError(401, \"UNAUTHENTICATED\", \"Authentication required\")`; a throw, or a principal whose `tenantId` differs from its `tenant`, is the 503; then set `request.principal`, `request.tenant` and, for a session, `request.sessionContext`; each 401 or 503 logs `request.log.warn({ code, reason? }, \"request refused\")` with `reason` `verifier_failed` or `tenant_mismatch` where it applies, implementing requirement \"A session request is authenticated before anything else runs\""}
